DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n**✨** **She Owns It AVL Meetup✨**\n
 \n**September Featured Guest:**\n**Lauren Gerber-Fleury\,** **founder of S
 avor Your Money and a financial coach who helps people move beyond money s
 tress\, shame\, and rigid budgeting to feel more confident and in control 
 of their money.**\n\n**Lauren will share her story—the experiences that 
 shaped her relationship with money\, what led her to create Savor Your Mon
 ey\, and what she’s learned about building a financial life that support
 s who you are and how you truly want to live.**\n\n**✨ This month also m
 arks ONE YEAR of She Owns It AVL!**\n\n**One year of gathering women ready
  to grow\, connect\, and belong through real conversations\, meaningful re
 lationships\, and stories that inspire us all.**\n\n**We can’t wait to c
 elebrate with you! 💫**\n**Doors open at 5:30**\n\n**We’re so grateful
  for everyone who signs up to join us! If your plans shift\, please update
  your RSVP—it helps us plan and opens a space for another woman to atten
 d.**
